obs MY OWN SHELVING REDDENED THE FIRST HOT PASS. fold_shelf_link_repoint refused at fold_depth_lost=2: the elder COPAL account carried links at the card's depth, and folding it into archive/ left both a directory too deep. The tool computed the one correction each resolves under and applied it; standing_equipment reddened behind it because a rostered guard had answered red.
obs That pass is void by my own hand -- the repair wrote a tracked file while it ran, so it closed tree_moved=yes, and a pass that did not measure the shipped tree is not a pass to claim on. Re-run clean: 220 run, 218 green, 0 red, 2 gated, tree_moved=no.
